--------------------------------
PLAYWRIGHT POPUP / ELEMENT VISIBILITY VALIDATION
--------------------------------

This code demonstrates how to validate whether an element is:

→ Visible
→ Hidden

It uses Playwright assertions:

→ toBeVisible()
→ toBeHidden()


--------------------------------
COMPLETE CODE
--------------------------------

import { expect, test } from '@playwright/test';

test("popup validation", async ({ page }) => {

    await page.goto("https://rahulshettyacademy.com/AutomationPractice/");

    await expect(page.locator("#displayed-text")).toBeVisible();

    await page.locator("#hide-textbox").click();

    await expect(page.locator("#displayed-text")).toBeHidden();

});


--------------------------------
1. OPEN THE WEBSITE
--------------------------------

await page.goto("https://rahulshettyacademy.com/AutomationPractice/");


→ Opens the Automation Practice website.


--------------------------------
2. VERIFY ELEMENT IS VISIBLE
--------------------------------

await expect(page.locator("#displayed-text")).toBeVisible();


`#displayed-text`

→ Locates the textbox/element using its ID.


`toBeVisible()`

→ Verifies that the element is currently visible.


So this line means:

"Verify that the displayed-text element is visible."


If visible:

✅ Assertion passes.


If not visible:

❌ Assertion fails.


--------------------------------
3. CLICK HIDE TEXTBOX
--------------------------------

await page.locator("#hide-textbox").click();


`#hide-textbox`

→ Locates the "Hide" button using its ID.


`.click()`

→ Clicks the button.


After clicking the button, the textbox becomes hidden.


Flow:

Hide button
    ↓
Click
    ↓
Textbox becomes hidden


--------------------------------
4. VERIFY ELEMENT IS HIDDEN
--------------------------------

await expect(page.locator("#displayed-text")).toBeHidden();


`toBeHidden()`

→ Verifies that the element is hidden.


So this line means:

"Verify that the displayed-text element is hidden."


If hidden:

✅ Assertion passes.


If still visible:

❌ Assertion fails.


--------------------------------
5. COMPLETE EXECUTION FLOW
--------------------------------

Open Automation Practice page
          ↓
Find #displayed-text
          ↓
Verify it is visible
          ↓
Find #hide-textbox
          ↓
Click Hide button
          ↓
Textbox becomes hidden
          ↓
Find #displayed-text
          ↓
Verify it is hidden


--------------------------------
6. toBeVisible() vs toBeHidden()
--------------------------------

toBeVisible()

→ Verifies that an element is visible.


toBeHidden()

→ Verifies that an element is hidden.


Easy way to remember:

Visible
   ↓
toBeVisible()


Hidden
   ↓
toBeHidden()


